## Practical tip

For database uniqueness, don't rely on the slug alone — append a short hash or counter:

```php
function uniqueSlug($title, $model)
{
    $base = slugify($title);
    $slug = $base;
    $i = 1;

    while ($model->where('slug', $slug)->exists()) {
        $slug = $base . '-' . $i++;
    }

    return $slug;
}
